<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-ROTA 1 PRINT HOUSE SHARE LIST.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-ROTA 1 PRINT HOUSE SHARE LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central depository said on</p>
<p>Friday that some 94 percent of Rota-1 printing house shares have</p>
<p>been blocked ahead of its shareholder meeting on March 21.</p>
<p>Some 35,936 shares were not blocked ahead of deadline. The</p>
<p>shares have to be blocked for shareholders to be able to take</p>
<p>part in the voting during the meeting.</p>
<p>Rotaa-1 total share capital is 640,500 shares.</p>
<p>The depository gave a list of the biggest shareholders,</p>
<p>controlling in total some 604,564 shares.</p>
<p>								  percent stake</p>
<p>    Aivars Zvirbulis publishing house Jana Seta SIA    68.25</p>
<p>    Baiba Dalmane						  11.55</p>
<p>    Biruta Kravale						  9.88</p>
<p>    Juris Mikelsons						 0.44</p>
<p>    Others (hold less than 0.50 percent)		    4.27</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
